<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; color: #231F20"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center; color: #231F20">EXPECTED TIMETABLE OF PRINCIPAL
EVENTS</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; color: #231F20"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 10pt">
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
